# Curriculum materials

Course slides are not stored in this repo (size + redistribution).

1. Download from: [your Drive link]
2. Place each week's files in the matching `week_NN/` folder
3. Run the ingestion:

   python 02_src/curriculum_ingest.py --curriculum 01_data/curriculum --db ./vectorstore

The `vectorstore/` folder is generated locally and is not committed.